<title>UK: UBS sets 2.0 bln French franc 12-year bond. [CORRECTED 14:55 GMT]</title>
<headline>UBS sets 2.0 bln French franc 12-year bond. [CORRECTED 14:55 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager UBS.</p>
<p> BORROWER   UBS (LONDON BRANCH)</p>
<p> AMT    2.0 BLN FRF   COUPON     5.875     MATURITY    18.AUG.09</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  99.308    PAY DATE    18.AUG.97</p>
<p>(Corrects pay date to August 18 from September 18.)</p>
<p> FULL FEES  0.375     REOFFER    99.308    SPREAD	+35 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	AA1	 LISTING    PARIS     GOV LAW     ENGLISH</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AA	  DENOMS (K) 10-100-1(M)</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   IPMA (2)</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.125     SELL CONC  0.25</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
